<li title=";}i:2;i:47508;}i:703;a:3:{i:0;s:18:"doublequoteopening";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:47943;}i:704;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:18:"Precedent Analysis";}i:2;i:47944;}i:705;a:3:{i:0;s:18:"doublequoteclosing";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:47962;}i:706;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:446:">(2) IA 227 of 2020 C.P. (IB) No.51/BB/2018 is disposed of with the directions that the Resolution Plan submitted by Swamitva Landmark, Shankeshwar Landmarks LLP and Shankeshwar Landmarks, shall be placed before the CoC along with the Resolution Plan filed by METL and submitted for our approval in IA 161, for the CoC's evaluation and approval, strictly keeping in mind the objects of the Code, and superior commercial viability.</li>
