<li title=";}i:2;i:48923;}i:731;a:3:{i:0;s:18:"doublequoteopening";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:49470;}i:732;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:10:"Conclusion";}i:2;i:49471;}i:733;a:3:{i:0;s:18:"doublequoteclosing";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:49481;}i:734;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:16:" data-structure=";}i:2;i:49482;}i:735;a:3:{i:0;s:18:"doublequoteopening";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:49498;}i:736;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:10:"Conclusion";}i:2;i:49499;}i:737;a:3:{i:0;s:18:"doublequoteclosing";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:49509;}i:738;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:544:">(6) The directions at sl nos. 1), 2) and 4) shall be carried out within a period of 12 weeks from the receipt/uploading of this order. This period is considered appropriate considering the psent Covid 19 pandemic situation and the ensuing lockdown in several states. The RP is granted liberty to bring an Application before this Adjudicating Authority for any further exclusion of time, if the same is for exceptional and justifiable reasons, and in the interest of completing the process and achieving the objects of the Code.</li>
